# Wesnoth Access end-to-end test: map review, information commands, hidden
# information protection and RNG neutrality, on the access_test scenario.
#ARGS: -t access_test

# Units the player cannot see must never be announced: the enemy leader
# (Orcish Warrior) is in fog and the Elvish Ranger hides in the forest.
never enemy Orcish Warrior
never Elvish Ranger

wait-for 180000 Your turn
expect Turn 1 of 10
expect gold 100

# The scenario shows its objectives in a dialog at the start; it is read out.
mark
wait-dialog 20000 transient_message
wait 300
key F4
expect Defeat the orc leader
key Enter
wait 800

# Information commands must not consume random numbers.
rng-mark

mark
key F9
expect Turn 1 of 10
expect gold 100
expect villages 0 of

mark
key F3
expect Lieutenant
expect 1 of 2

mark
key F3
expect Spearman
expect 2 of 2
expect 4, 4

# Hex navigation around the Spearman at 4,4 (even column).
mark
key W
expect 4, 3
key S
expect 4, 4
key E
expect 5, 4
# From an odd column north-west goes up one row: back to 4,4 with south-west.
key A
expect 4, 4
key D
expect 5, 5
key A
expect 4, 5
expect Hills
key Q
expect 3, 5

mark
key C
expect 3, 5

mark
key Backspace
expect 4, 5

# Village, label and item.
mark
key F5
expect village
expect 4, 2

mark
key K
expect keep, your Lieutenant
expect 2, 4
mark
key K
expect keep, empty
expect 15, 4

mark
key Ctrl+F5
expect Ford
expect 3, 7

mark
key F4
expect Orcish Grunt
expect 7, 4
expect 1 of 1

mark
key V
expect enemy Orcish Grunt
expect hit points
expect attacks

mark
key Shift+V
expect resistance

mark
key X
expect Grass
expect 7, 4

mark
key Z
expect north
expect south-west

mark
key Shift+C
expect map 16 columns by 8 rows

mark
key F8
expect Defeat the orc leader

mark
key Ctrl+F9
expect 2 units
expect 1 visible enemies

rng-unchanged

# Select the Spearman and look at its options.
mark
key Home
# Nothing is selected yet: Home goes to the leader.
expect Lieutenant
key F3
key F3
mark
key Enter
expect Selected
expect Spearman
expect reachable hexes

mark
key F6
expect moves left
expect 1 of

mark
key F7
expect Orcish Grunt
expect Press Enter to open the attack dialog

rng-unchanged

# Escape clears the selection; with nothing selected a second Escape is
# needed for the game's quit question.
mark
key Escape
expect Selection cleared
mark
key Escape
expect Press Escape again

# Settings dialog and command reference are reachable from the map.
mark
key Shift+F2
wait 1000
expect Accessibility Settings
key Escape
wait 500

mark
key F2
wait 1000
expect Wesnoth Access Commands
key Escape
wait 500

# The game's help (legacy browser) through the keyboard reader: the help page
# of the unit under the cursor.
mark
key F4
expect Orcish Grunt
mark
key Ctrl+Alt+D
wait-for 20000 Help. Up and Down
expect Orcish Grunt
mark
key Down
key Down
expect Race
mark
key Tab
expect link
key Enter
wait 1000
mark
key Backspace
expect Orcish Grunt
mark
key Left
expect of
key Down
expect of
key Escape
wait 1500
mark
key C
expect 7, 4

# Repeat and history.
mark
key F12
expect 5 hexes north-east from your leader
mark
key Shift+F12
expect of

quit
